      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Spheer is a mix between a clicker and a tower defense game.\nYou build
    up your planet with upgrades, defend against waves of aliens,\nand eventually
    migrate to new planets to start the cycle again\u2014stronger each time.\n\nI
    started making this game as a way to learn Unity and get better at game development,\nwith
    the goal of building even bigger and better games in the future.\n\nThanks for
    playing!\n\nMusic ---------- Pyrex\n3D models  -- Joe\nCode ---------- glenpickle"
